<title>AUSTRIA: Vienna bourse trading resumes.</title>
<headline>Vienna bourse trading resumes.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vienna stock exchange said trading on its electronic EQOS had resumed at 0925 GMT after it was suspended for about an hour because of technical problems.</p>
<p>The bourse said it had no plans to extend Monday's trading session and that the market would close as usual at 1400 GMT. -- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
